# CODEOWNERS
#
# This file lists the people / teams who should be requested as reviewers for
# files matching the patterns below. Patterns follow GitHub's CODEOWNERS
# format (last matching pattern wins).
#
# Until more owners are added, the project lead (@rebuildup) is the default
# reviewer. When meaningful separate reviewers exist, request them explicitly
# rather than self-assigning as reviewer just to fill the field.

# Default owner for everything
* @rebuildup

# Project-local policy files: explicitly require project-lead review
/CLAUDE.md             @rebuildup
/CONTRIBUTING.md       @rebuildup
/README.md             @rebuildup
/LICENSE               @rebuildup

# AI agent configuration
/.claude/              @rebuildup

# Docs
/docs/                 @rebuildup

# GitHub workflow definitions and CODEOWNERS itself
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @rebuildup
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/        @rebuildup
/.github/workflows/             @rebuildup